{
  "slug": "persona",
  "name": "Persona",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "The user can inject experts into their Claude Code session. It provides the programmed experts with specific priorities, communication styles, and domain knowledge to help.\nEach persona has references and skills for improved capabilities and the user can even delegate tasks to personas which will spawn subagents to complete the task with their domain expertise.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `persona` (Activate, list, create, edit, delete, or deactivate expert personas that shape how Claude assists you).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install persona@claude-community` from `tatertot365/claude-persona-plugin`.\n\nSwitch Claude into expert modes mid-conversation. One command activates a specialist persona — security expert, debugger, architect, and more — shaping Claude's priorities, communication style, and domain focus for the rest of the session.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
